on mouseUp
  [  0] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [  2] extcall 4 ............................... updateStage()
  [  4] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [  6] thebuiltin 6 ............................ <the frame>
  [  8] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 10] thebuiltin 6 ............................ <the frame>
  [ 12] pushint8 50 ............................. <50>
